The Pragmatist: Hello there, my friend!
The Pragmatist: So glad you made it out of there! I heard all sorts of awful noises after I left.
The Pragmatist: Thank you for talking me out of staying. I was so caught up feeling safe and secure, that I would have missed out on all this beauty. 
The Pragmatist: Truly, I owe you the world.
